{
 "_doc": "The apprentice model's defaults (company/tools/apprentice.js, docs/APPRENTICE.md). The owner's own settings live in company/state/apprentice.json, written only by `apprentice.js enable|configure --by owner` (or the console); a hand edit there turns the apprentice off. enabled here is ignored: the apprentice is off until the owner turns it on, and it runs only in the sandbox company.",
 "_example": { "baseUrl": "http://192.0.2.10:8420", "namespace": "slaingi", "tenant": "sandbox", "keySecret": "slaingi-key" },
